{
  "name": "empty",
  "domain": "ux-review",
  "format": "flow-spec",
  "description": "流程没有任何步骤、也没有任何分支：P0 产出空集，P1 也无从排除。空集本身就是结论——没有可审的交互面。",
  "input": {
    "format": "flow-spec",
    "payload": {
      "flow": { "id": "empty", "name": "空流程", "steps": [] },
      "branches": [],
      "prototype": { "nodes": [] }
    }
  },
  "expect": {
    "candidates": 0,
    "paths": [],
    "admitted": 0,
    "excludedByPredicate": {},
    "bounded": true,
    "truncated": false
  },
  "anchors": {
    "positive": [
      {
        "note": "流程为空不影响锚点重算：只要给出步骤表与分支表，步骤侧仍可核对，证据侧仍可滑窗定位。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "flow-step-and-node",
          "path": "empty/b/happy/s1",
          "locator": { "branchId": "happy", "stepId": "s1" },
          "excerpt": "next = s2"
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "empty/b/happy/s1",
          "flow": { "id": "empty", "steps": [{ "id": "s1" }] },
          "branches": [{ "id": "happy", "kind": "happy", "steps": ["s1"] }],
          "documents": [
            { "path": "empty/b/happy/s1", "content": "next = s2\n" }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "anchored",
        "expectTier": "recomputed-unique",
        "expectStart": 1
      }
    ],
    "negative": [
      {
        "note": "步骤侧缺一半：只给步骤 id 不给分支 id -> 无法证明「这个步骤在这条分支上」，未锚定。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "flow-step-and-node",
          "path": "empty/b/happy/s1",
          "locator": { "stepId": "s1" },
          "excerpt": "next = s2"
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "empty/b/happy/s1",
          "flow": { "id": "empty", "steps": [{ "id": "s1" }] },
          "branches": [{ "id": "happy", "kind": "happy", "steps": ["s1"] }],
          "documents": [
            { "path": "empty/b/happy/s1", "content": "next = s2\n" }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "no-match"
      },
      {
        "note": "证据侧缺一半：原文为空 -> 没有可核验的证据，未锚定。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "flow-step-and-node",
          "path": "empty/b/happy/s1",
          "locator": { "branchId": "happy", "stepId": "s1" },
          "excerpt": "   "
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "empty/b/happy/s1",
          "flow": { "id": "empty", "steps": [{ "id": "s1" }] },
          "branches": [{ "id": "happy", "kind": "happy", "steps": ["s1"] }],
          "documents": [
            { "path": "empty/b/happy/s1", "content": "next = s2\n" }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "empty-excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "ambiguous": []
  }
}
